What does the code print?

```java
class Book {
    protected int pages;
    public Book() { pages = 150; }
}
class Dictionary extends Book {
    private int defs;
    public Dictionary(int x) {
        pages = 2 * pages;
        defs = x;
    }
    public void show() {
        MiniJava.write("Number of pages: " + pages);
        MiniJava.write("Number of defs: " + defs);
        MiniJava.write("Defs per page: " + defs / pages);
    }
}
Dictionary d = new Dictionary(12400);
d.show();
```

